<title>POLAND: Boryszew Q4 net rises to PLN 3.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Boryszew Q4 net rises to PLN 3.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boryszew results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     6.57   vs    4.07</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 6.19   vs    4.52</p>
<p>    net profit			     3.75   vs    2.57</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Boryszew SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     31.08   vs   34.73</p>
<p>    costs of sales			24.44   vs   29.81</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  n.a.   vs    0.01</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     2.44   vs    1.95</p>
<p>    other taxes			    n.a.   vs    n.a.</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.44   vs    0.56</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.82   vs    1.63</p>
<p>    investment			     4.64   vs    0.75</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		    16.54   vs   14.05</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			14.01   vs   11.54</p>
<p>    net profit			     8.22   vs    7.15</p>
<p>    net sales			     99.89   vs  106.42</p>
<p>    costs of sales			83.73   vs   94.38</p>
<p>    extraordinary			 -0.17   vs    0.01</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     5.79   vs    4.39</p>
<p>    other taxes			     n.a.  vs    n.a.</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   1.28   vs    2.84</p>
<p>    financial costs			3.64   vs    5.36</p>
<p>    investment				n.a.  vs    n.a.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
